{"id": "De42qMky5_d", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "Daal pe rehta toh bach jaata… par phir kabhi pahaad ke us paar nahi dekh paata 🍂\n\nBaaki patte hanse. Par ek patte ne phir bhi hawa ka haath thaam liya.\nDhaaga toota. Sarson ke khet, nehar, shehar ki patangein… aur door, barf wale pahaad.\nHar din thoda hara rang utarta gaya, chattaanon ne use chheela, uske aansu raat ki os mein chhup gaye.\nPhir bhi woh chadhta raha… aur shikhar pe pahunch ke, doobte suraj ke saamne, sirf nason ka ek jaal reh gaya ✨\n\nDaal pe uska jodiwala aaj bhi waisa hi hara hai.\nPar ab jab hawa chalti hai, woh bhi shikhar ki taraf mud jaata hai. Kyunki uski har nas mein ek safar hai.\n\n🎵 Patta · Harmeeet · music Aditya Pushkarna · Hustle 5 (Apna Homeground)\n@harmeeet_yr\n\nTum kaunse patte ho: daal wale ya safar wale? Aur usko bhejo jo apni daal chhod ke sapne ke peeche nikla hai 🤍\n\nPatta Harmeeet | Patta song | Harmeeet Hustle 5 | Hustle 5 songs | MTV Hustle 5 | Hindi rap storytelling | motivational Hindi rap | leaf story animation | paper art animation | herbarium art | animated music video\n\n#Patta #Harmeeet #Hustle5 #HindiRap #PaperArt\n\nLeaf scans: Biswarup Ganguly (CC BY 3.0), Auckland Museum (CC BY 4.0), Billings-Kittredge Herbaria (public domain)", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792869251, "like_count": 7680, "comment_count": 47, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1800189277982869a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.701, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.